<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea grains/oilseeds tender results for January.</title>
<headline>S.Korea grains/oilseeds tender results for January.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea bought during January at least 1,076,800 tonnes of grains and oilseeds -- 852,500 tonnes of corn, 86,000 tonnes of wheat, 55,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean, 78,800 tonnes of Indian soymeal, and 4,500 tonnes of Indian rapeseed meal -- through tenders and private negotiations.</p>
<p>This compared with a total 230,500 tonnes purchased in December.</p>
